        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DASHCP, Floor Spring Hinge Cover Plates</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSolid brass cover plates for floor spring hinges. These screw to the door face at the bottom of the door to hide the cutout for a horizontal floor spring hinge.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFits <a href=\"/products/floor-spring-hinge-set-deltana-dash95\"><b>Deltana DASH95 Floor Spring Hinge</b></a> and other manufacture's hinges.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DASHCP Floor Spring Hinge Cover Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DASHCP-specifications.pdf?v=1691095331\"><b>Deltana DASHCP Specifications (PDF)</a></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually (1 Plate)</i>\r\n</p>",
